{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Make paternity tests compulsory before paying child maintenance",
        "additional_details": "We believe that fathers find themselves in a precarious situation when they are compelled to pay child maintenance for a child whose paternity they are uncertain of. There are also countless mothers who are denied the financial support they deserve for their child because the issue of paternity remains contested.\r\n \r\nThis can lead to confusion, unfair financial responsibilities, emotional distress for all parties involved, and children missing out on vital support.",
        "background": "Legislate to require paternity tests to be taken before a father makes child maintenance payments.",
